WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.767
Breaking news.

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.068
Police say at least five

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.370
people are dead

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.671
after a shooting

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.573
at a Colorado Springs nightclub.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.340
The shooting happened

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:07.874
just before

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.175
midnight at Club Q

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.411
It's an LGBTQ nightclub.

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.446
Another 18 people

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.814
were injured in that shooting,

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.782
according to authorities.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.850
Colorado Springs

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.753
police say they have a suspect in custody

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.488
That person is currently being

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:24.724
treated at an area hospital

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.993
Moving forward,

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.328
we have

00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:31.731
numerous homicide detectives on scene.

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.833
They'll be processing the scene.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.869
The scene is going to take some time

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:37.103
to get through.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:40.807
So we will be here for many, many hours

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.242
to come.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:43.977
So far, police have declined

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:45.678
to speak about a possible motive,

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:48.181
but the club put out this statement.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.282
Club Q

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:49.916
is devastated

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.152
by the senseless attack on our community.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.686
Our prayers and thoughts are

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.188
with all the victims

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.090
and their families and friends.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.892
We thank the quick reactions

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.493
of heroic customers

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:01.661
that subdued the gunman

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:04.831
and ended this hate attack All right.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.900
Joining us now is Chief Charles Ramsey.

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.401
CNN senior law enforcement

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.537
analyst and former Washington, D.C.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:11.271
police chief.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.272
Good morning to you, Chief.

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.841
So the nightclub

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:15.909
calling it a hate attack.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.977
We don't know if that exactly is the case

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:18.311
right now.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.679
There is a suspect in custody,

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:20.713
but what are your first thoughts

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.315
knowing that this happened?

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:25.185
A deadly shooting happened inside

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.052
a gay nightclub?

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.021
Well, first of

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:28.254
all, the

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.290
police are wise not to release

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.791
a motive at this point in time.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.560
It's too early in the investigation.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.561
They've got a lot of work

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.361
that they have to do.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:37.163
They have to interview witnesses.

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.332
They have to interview the suspect.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.467
There's just a lot of work

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.768
that needs to be done.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.503
This could be just an argument

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:44.904
that got out of hand

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.207
and wound up resulting in gunfire.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.708
It could be a hate crime,

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.043
could be a variety of things.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.278
But five dead is tragic.

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.313
It's very unfortunate.

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.681
Another 18 people injured.

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.149
And I think it's important to remember,

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.951
we don't know whether those injuries

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.052
were gunshot wounds

00:01:59.052 --> 00:01:59.986
or just

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.087
injuries sustained

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:01.888
when people are trying

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:03.823
to escape the scene.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.258
So there's a lot of information

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:06.493
and it still needs to come out.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.229
And she you know,

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:09.729
even though

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:10.964
it is too early, at some point

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.265
