00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.569
Social media you look for.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:17.670
Whether anything was said,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.771
I mean, what are the clues?

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:19.606
What are the tip offs

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:21.641
besides the obvious that someone

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:22.142
might have said

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.209
