00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.085
social media footprint.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:33.386
You know what does that look like?

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.522
If they made threats before, you know,

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.190
is there information

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.125
that would lead them down a path

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.628
that would take them to an actual motive?

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.329
Were they involved with

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:45.698
somebody in the club and that person

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.668
was injured as a result of the up

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:49.502
the shooting?

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:50.069
I mean, there's just

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:51.504
a lot of pieces of the puzzle

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.072
that still need to be put together.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.140
That's what investigators

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.041
